OL,3,GNEWSAHomes rise from ashes of former
OL,4,Ashoe factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun on building dozens of
OL,7,Fnew homes on the site of a former shoe
OL,8,Ffactory which was gutted by fire.
OL,10,FNorwich City Council said the 48
OL,11,Fproperties ` a mixture of one and
OL,12,Ftwo-bed flats ` would be available to
OL,13,Frent for people on its housing
OL,14,Fregister.
OL,16,FThe council bought the former Van-Dal
OL,17,Ffactory on Dibden Road following the
OL,18,Fblaze in January last year, then sold
OL,19,Fit to social-housing firm Flagship
OL,20,FHomes.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
